# PREAMBLE

OneDraft™ is an AI-native architectural, engineering, and construction drafting platform designed to transform project requirements, design intent, spatial relationships, technical standards, and structured building information into coordinated CAD documentation.

OneDraft™ is built upon a canonical project model connecting requirements, organizations, projects, sites, buildings, levels, grids, spaces, elements, assemblies, parameters, constraints, relationships, geometry references, model versions, revisions, change records, commands, design proposals, views, drawings, sheets, dimensions, annotations, schedules, redlines, redline resolutions, code sources, code rules, code checks, and associated project-domain objects.

The OneDraft™ project is intended to provide a continuous computational relationship between design intent, structured project information, geometry, documentation, validation, revision, and project history.

This Master Project License establishes the permissions and restrictions governing the use, development, implementation, modification, contribution, distribution, deployment, and commercial exploitation of the OneDraft™ project and its protected materials.

The fundamental purpose of this License is to permit development of **OneDraft™ as OneDraft™**, while preserving the identity, continuity, provenance, intellectual property, project architecture, trademark, and commercial control of the OneDraft™ project.

