# PROVISION 16 — CANONICAL DOMAIN MODEL

The OneDraft™ canonical domain model forms part of the Project architecture.

The canonical model includes, among other designated entities:

Organization, User, Project, Requirement, Site, Building, Level, Grid, Space, Element, Assembly, Parameter, Constraint, Relationship, GeometryReference, ModelVersion, Revision, ChangeRecord, AriaCommand, DesignProposal, View, Drawing, Sheet, SheetTemplate, Dimension, Annotation, Schedule, Redline, RedlineResolution, CodeSource, CodeRule, CodeCheck, and associated domain objects.

The domain model may be extended through authorized Project development.

Unauthorized extraction and use of the canonical domain architecture to establish a substantially equivalent independently branded platform is not granted by this License.

